body:
I fixed it. Problem was in HttpObjectAggregator. Object this.currentMessage been never released.

Just comment out 196 line in HttpObjectAggregator:
   this.currentMessage = null;

And currentMessage releases now in "HttpObjectAggregator.channelInactive" method:

currentMessage.release();

So, all works fine now!

```
  @@ -193,7 +193,6 @@ public class HttpObjectAggregator extends MessageToMessageDecoder<HttpObject> {
         }

          if (last) {
           -                this.currentMessage = null;

               // Merge trailing headers into the message.
             if (chunk instanceof LastHttpContent) {
